#>wonder_trial_threshold_ladders
?["Are the ladders of liminality one ladder said nine ways, or nine things that rhyme?"]{
 #:depth #!semantics ~#lens(comparison)
 ~#readings: ["one: entry, middle and far are the same three rungs everywhere, and one vocabulary should name them", "nine: each measures a different thing (a cell's audience, a form's place, beats, earning, materialization), and a shared word would hide that", "two edges: the ladders agree only that a far rung is far by being kept or by being let go"]
